Provenance note (record, not a license restriction)
---------------------------------------------------
The vendored server base inside server-core/ originates from the aegra
project (commit 2693066413dfafce3fd21bf581f10bd2495b8dd3, originally
Apache-2.0). On Nov 23, 2026 the upstream owner granted this repository's
owner written permission to use and redistribute that vendored code under
the MIT license for this company's internal use. Everything in this
repository is therefore MIT-licensed. Provenance details are kept in
server-core/NOTICE.md for attribution and upgrade tracking only.
